<view class="page community-page"><view class="community-head fade-in"><view><view class="eyebrow">FORGELAB / MOBILE COMMUNITY</view><view class="title">一起把工厂做得更好。</view></view><button class="compose-top" bindtap="openComposer">+ 发布</button></view><view class="community-copy fade-in">存档、模型、布局经验和现场问题，在移动端留下可复用的上下文。</view><view class="community-status fade-in delay-1"><view class="status-dot status-dot-running"></view><text>{{online ? 'ForgeLab 在线同步' : '本地社区快照'}}</text><text class="status-right">{{online ? 'LIVE FEED' : 'OFFLINE READY'}}</text></view><view class="community-search card fade-in delay-1"><text>⌕</text><input value="{{query}}" placeholder="搜索帖子、作者或关键词" bindinput="inputQuery" /></view><view class="community-tabs fade-in delay-1"><button class="community-tab {{filter === 'all' ? 'community-active' : ''}}" data-filter="all" bindtap="selectFilter">全部</button><button class="community-tab {{filter === 'help' ? 'community-active' : ''}}" data-filter="help" bindtap="selectFilter">求助</button><button class="community-tab {{filter === 'share' ? 'community-active' : ''}}" data-filter="share" bindtap="selectFilter">经验分享</button></view><view class="feed-list fade-in delay-2"><block wx:for="{{visibleFeed}}" wx:key="id"><view class="feed-card card"><view class="feed-top"><view class="avatar tone-{{item.tone}}">{{item.initial}}</view><view class="feed-author"><view class="author-name">{{item.author}}</view><view class="author-role">{{item.role}} · {{item.time}}</view></view><text class="tag tag-{{item.tone}}">{{item.tag}}</text></view><button class="feed-title" data-title="{{item.title}}" data-body="{{item.body}}" bindtap="openPost">{{item.title}}</button><view class="feed-body">{{item.body}}</view><view class="feed-actions"><button class="feed-action {{item.liked ? 'liked' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="toggleLike">♡ {{item.likes}}</button><text class="feed-action">◌ {{item.comments}}</text><text class="feed-action feed-open">阅读全文 ↗</text></view></view></block></view><view wx:if="{{!visibleFeed.length}}" class="empty card"><view class="empty-title">没有匹配的动态</view><view class="empty-copy">换个关键词，或者发布一条现场记录。</view></view><view class="community-note card-dark"><view class="note-kicker">COMMUNITY RULE</view><view class="note-title">先写清事实，再分享结论。</view><view class="note-copy">资源请注明来源与许可；布局经验请保留版本、种子和验证条件。移动端只做分享与协作，不替代工程审批。</view></view><view wx:if="{{composer}}" class="composer-mask"><view class="composer-card"><view class="composer-head"><view><view class="eyebrow">FIELD NOTE / NEW POST</view><view class="composer-title">发布一条现场记录</view></view><button class="close-button" bindtap="closeComposer">×</button></view><textarea value="{{draft}}" placeholder="记录你看到的信号、上下文或经验…" bindinput="inputDraft" maxlength="500" /><view class="composer-foot"><text>{{draft.length}} / 500</text><button class="primary composer-submit" bindtap="publish">发布到本地动态</button></view></view></view></view>
